cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software (this file) and the accompanying paper."
title: "gaplike: exact inference on gapped and windowed stationary Gaussian data"
abstract: >-
  Joint signal and noise-parameter estimation for stationary Gaussian time
  series interrupted by data gaps. Provides gap-pattern generation, windowed
  frequency-domain covariances, and a hierarchy of likelihoods from the
  Whittle approximation to the exact time-domain solver, the latter evaluated
  either in closed form (two noise components, simultaneous diagonalization)
  or matrix-free at arbitrary scale by preconditioned conjugate gradients.
type: software
